Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.94,0:00:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you know there's an awesome\Ntreasure hidden at the end of the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.22,0:00:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And anyone who finds it,\Nthe King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.94,0:00:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that exciting or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.48,0:00:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are incredible adventures\Nout there just waiting for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage, have the courage\Nthat sail and believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.60,0:00:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we will see a glimpse of the sunroar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.92,0:00:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back when we first started,\Nwe had separate horizons,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.23,0:00:50.41,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Video Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.23,0:00:50.41,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}fedew\NZenef
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.06,0:00:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sailed toward different dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things have changed now,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.78,0:00:55.70,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Graphics
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.78,0:00:55.70,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Datenshi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.02,0:00:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for together we found, we looked\Nthrough the spyglass and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.20,0:01:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we know that our hearts\Nhave brought us here.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.79,0:01:01.04,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Quality Control
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.79,0:01:01.04,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Gab\NGalaxy 9000\NPepperjack\NWestfal
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.04,0:01:07.80,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Karaoke
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.04,0:01:07.80,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}KaitouYahiko
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.82,0:01:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the conscious point's our destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.44,0:01:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no looking back,\Ntake the hell with me!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.80,0:01:11.80,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Soundtracking
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.80,0:01:11.80,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.18,0:01:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't stop all our\Ntroubles, forget the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.34,0:01:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though the future's\Nunclear, we still can smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.28,0:01:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know we'll get the regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.42,0:01:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every tear that we pride only helps.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.81,0:01:27.44,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Timing/Typesetting
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.81,0:01:27.44,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}Gab
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.40,0:01:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saw dreams come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.62,0:01:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and those dreams\Nare precious in my life.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.57,0:01:37.04,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\bord3\pos(964,111.4)}Translation
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.57,0:01:37.04,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(1007.02,152.05)}Funimation
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.40,0:01:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A glimpse of the sun\Nrising on our tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.20,0:01:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A snake!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.12,0:01:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.86,0:01:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kalgara, look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.54,0:01:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.80,0:01:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize that\Nsnake had a grandchild
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.60,0:01:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that snake
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.46,0:02:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Would.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.20,0:02:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you look at that it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.44,0:02:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doesn't make any sense those two were trying\Nto kill each other not too long ago now
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.90,0:02:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're laughing together\Nlike good friends
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.46,0:02:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,usually Kokoro isn't\Nvery friendly with the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.18,0:02:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,villagers either I've never seen him smile
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.58,0:02:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like that before we climb\Ndown here, climb down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.42,0:02:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that ringing kalgara\Nwhere's that beautiful
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.43,0:02:43.69,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H181818&\3c&H181818&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(730,0)\t(688,730,\1a&H00&)}The Light of Shandora
Dialogue: 2,0:02:39.43,0:02:43.69,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HE5E6E6&\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(730,0)}The Light of Shandora
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.20,0:02:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ringing coming from follow\Nme and i will show you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.20,0:03:05.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.08,0:03:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.28,0:03:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're speechless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.96,0:03:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.48,0:03:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Shandora, and we're the\Nsurvivors of this golden city.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.44,0:03:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A city of gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.16,0:03:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like I'm dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.40,0:03:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a city full of treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.74,0:03:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's gold everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.80,0:03:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.16,0:03:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.04,0:03:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.08,0:03:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Load up your ship with\Nall the treasure you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.74,0:03:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave the Golden Bell!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.08,0:03:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the villagers here\Nagree that this is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.88,0:03:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.02,0:04:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We want to thank you for saving our\Ntribe from that terrible disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.72,0:04:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is nothing at all
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.66,0:04:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand haven't your people\Nbeen working hard to protect this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.46,0:04:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.68,0:04:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have worked hard to protect it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.02,0:04:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, it's not necessarily\Nthe treasure we guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.38,0:04:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, let me show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.60,0:04:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing we guard is this stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.46,0:04:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that writing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.94,0:04:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.44,0:04:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.30,0:04:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is a poneglyph, writings\Nleft over from ancient history.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.14,0:04:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean this isn't something that\Nwas written by your ancestors?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.74,0:04:53.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is only one thing we know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.26,0:04:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That the city of Shandora fought and\Nfell trying to protect this stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.36,0:04:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we will too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.12,0:05:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We feel it is our duty to continue\Nto protect it with the same resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.78,0:05:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This stone now represents proof that our\Nancestors not only fought a vicious fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.20,0:05:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.78,0:05:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we revere our ancestors as\Nwe would our gods. But still,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.38,0:05:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when I heard the bell ringing before,\NI had no idea it would be this huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.50,0:05:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's for them. Words?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.30,0:05:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.22,0:05:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It speaks so that the spirits\Nof our ancestors who have passed
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.88,0:05:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can still return to this land at\Nany time without getting lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.34,0:05:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We continue to ring the bell as\Nif to shout to them, We are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.90,0:05:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.26,0:05:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.80,0:05:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.58,0:05:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sound itself proclaims\Nthe glory of Shandora,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.16,0:05:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,making its existence known\Nto the ends of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.20,0:05:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It shouts, we will never run or hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.04,0:05:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of this, we have\Ngiven the Grand Bell a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.04,0:05:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We call it the Fire of Shandora.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.84,0:06:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.90,0:06:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That explains the majestic sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.40,0:06:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think so? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.12,0:06:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was this fire that reached out\Nto us and helped us arrive here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.46,0:06:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard the ringing\Nduring a terrible storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.58,0:06:19.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard it clearly when it\Nshouldn't have been audible at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.50,0:06:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You like the bells ringing too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.84,0:06:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I bet you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.66,0:06:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet someday you'll grow up\Njust like that other giant snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.92,0:06:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But probably not for\Nanother hundred years!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.54,0:06:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Noland, I invite you to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.96,0:06:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, it's been 400\Nyears since Shandora fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.66,0:06:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're the first guest we've\Nhad, so I want to welcome you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.14,0:06:53.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Won't you accept my offer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.38,0:06:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Kal 'gara.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.90,0:06:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And with your permission,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.06,0:07:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would also love the opportunity\Nto collect some plants
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.54,0:07:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from the forest and see this\Nplague all the way through.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.14,0:07:04.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commodore!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.05,0:07:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commodore!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.18,0:07:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.48,0:07:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with the clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.70,0:07:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found an eternal compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.04,0:07:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And look at this map, Commodore!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.88,0:07:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.92,0:07:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We took these items from\Nthose who intruded upon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.02,0:07:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that skull shape is\Ndefinitely our island.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.80,0:07:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name Shandora means\Nthe skull's right eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.76,0:07:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name refers to the\Ncity's location right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.16,0:07:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.98,0:07:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And make sure she gets\Nplenty of rest, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.70,0:07:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will, thanks! Goodbye, Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.42,0:07:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey look everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.86,0:07:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nolan brought us some exotic crops!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.34,0:07:49.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a greenhouse on our ship\Nwith all kinds of plant samples.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.72,0:07:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll leave some seeds and sprouts\Nhere that are suited for your soil.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.54,0:08:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.94,0:08:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha! Ha! Ha! Ha! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.90,0:08:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.74,0:08:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.66,0:08:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, time to begin\Nanother day of hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.20,0:08:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hard work doing what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.56,0:08:49.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having a campfire party?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.84,0:09:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.48,0:09:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would the doctor\Nand the others do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.08,0:09:10.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chief, Noland and the others are coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.56,0:09:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are not to say\Nanything about last night!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.16,0:09:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.52,0:09:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They said they are going\Nto set sail in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.96,0:09:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.20,0:09:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do anything rash!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.80,0:09:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you hear me? Fine then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.74,0:09:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our people will never\Nunderstand each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.84,0:09:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've only done harm.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:25.96,0:09:30.42,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord0\fsp2\fscx90\fscy90\c&HFFFEFF&\blur1.3\pos(720,565)\fad(481,0)}One Month After Landfall
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.96,0:09:30.42,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord3.5\fsp2\fscx90\fscy90\c&H251F19&\1a&HFF&\blur1.3\pos(720,565)\3c&H251F19&\fad(481,0)\t(439,481,\1a&H00&)}One Month After Landfall
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.30,0:09:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care how good his medicine is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.26,0:09:30.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still a god killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.86,0:09:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do these people think they can just show\Nup here and stomp all over our history?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.80,0:09:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.16,0:09:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must endure it, and we must\Nwait quietly for them to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.12,0:09:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.14,0:09:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.60,0:09:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for Kalgara.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.08,0:10:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is everyone acting\Nso cold all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.76,0:10:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And where's Kalgara?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.22,0:10:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turn around and leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.96,0:10:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.26,0:10:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're outsiders.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.06,0:10:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kalgara doesn't want to see you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.04,0:10:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seto, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.62,0:10:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When are you going to leave anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.12,0:10:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.42,0:10:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on? It seems like\Nthey suddenly hate us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.68,0:10:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hold on you can't just start\Nacting like this it's not fair
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.10,0:10:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let it go let's continue our
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.70,0:10:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,work we still have some forest
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.70,0:10:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to inspect there you are\NKalgara Nolan has been looking
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.88,0:10:43.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.79,0:10:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know he has.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.44,0:10:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no desire to speak to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.44,0:10:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I see him right now, I'm afraid I might
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.30,0:10:59.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.21,0:11:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.26,0:11:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bell didn't ring today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.46,0:11:04.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's the first\Ntime that's happened in
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.00,0:11:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the month that we've been here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.16,0:11:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commodore?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.07,0:11:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be done exploring\Nthe forest in two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.68,0:11:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.92,0:11:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let everyone know we\Nset sail in three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.58,0:11:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell them this is their last chance\Nto enjoy dry land for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.88,0:11:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commodore, to tell you the truth, I\Ncan't wait to get off this insane island.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.02,0:11:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only after we finish our duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.76,0:11:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.58,0:11:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should stay here, Noland.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.82,0:11:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.06,0:11:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you make Moose your wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.12,0:11:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.22,0:11:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a family at home\Nand kids who are her age.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.42,0:11:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're outsiders.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.26,0:11:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kalgara doesn't want to see you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.00,0:11:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When are you going to leave anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.54,0:11:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.04,0:12:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're here, Kalgara!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.40,0:12:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come out, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.24,0:12:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't understand what's\Ngoing on unless you talk to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.80,0:12:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.64,0:12:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention unfair! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.22,0:12:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, we set sail in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.74,0:12:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want us to part like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.86,0:12:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you show your face here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.80,0:12:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want your wife to\Nlive her life as a widow?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.24,0:12:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Commodore seems sad lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.26,0:12:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.08,0:12:52.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He thought he made such\Na good friend out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.32,0:12:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of this makes any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.16,0:13:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like we're going to set\Nsail first thing tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.12,0:13:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The villagers are so upset\Nthat we can't go near them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.00,0:13:08.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, I don't remember ever\Nhearing the bell ring today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.66,0:13:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you show your face here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.56,0:13:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want your wife to\Nlive her life as a widow?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.96,0:13:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta say, this is definitely\Na tough way to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.64,0:13:42.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.55,0:13:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did I believe he was a botanist?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.66,0:13:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Noland!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.86,0:13:56.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If these are the unfortunate\Nvictims of your advancement,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.78,0:14:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then we never should have accepted\Nyou or trusted you the way we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.80,0:14:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kindred trees?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.92,0:14:07.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.62,0:14:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been told that the spirits of\Nour ancestors who died on this island
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are guided back by the sound of a bell\Nso that they may rest inside them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.96,0:14:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since the age of Shandora,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.82,0:14:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,every one of our ancestors who\Nlived on the island watches over us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.48,0:14:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They watch over us from\Nthose sacred white trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.28,0:14:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Important to us Shandians.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.86,0:14:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is why we've protected them\Nas we've protected our own lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.98,0:14:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's more than just a forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.16,0:14:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's our history.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.94,0:14:43.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you see now why we\Nhold these trees sacred?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.50,0:14:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we just chopped them all down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.28,0:14:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The warriors felt so betrayed and angry,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.06,0:14:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they grabbed their weapons\Nin search of revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.46,0:14:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must drive them off this island!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.60,0:14:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.96,0:15:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But because you had already saved so many.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.78,0:15:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lives here they couldn't just I understand
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.16,0:15:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were so grateful\Nthat they couldn't act
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.22,0:15:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on it but doctor even\Nif it was just for tree
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.66,0:15:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Research even if you\Ndidn't know the villagers
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.86,0:15:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,anger won't go away so\Nbefore you go I thought
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.36,0:15:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd ask. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.48,0:15:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to know the reason why.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.36,0:15:35.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So their ancestor spirits\Nare in those trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.30,0:15:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.84,0:15:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now we've done something\Nterrible that we can't reverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.48,0:15:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have every right to\Nbe as angry as they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.40,0:15:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, Commodore, we had no choice...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.42,0:15:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.58,0:15:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was too wrapped up in my own\Ninterests to even consider theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.94,0:15:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was told that besides\Nproclaiming the city's existence,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.30,0:16:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Bell also served as a guide for\Ntheir ancestors to return to the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.78,0:16:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we just cut them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.16,0:16:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We do not deserve their forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.38,0:16:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commodore, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.94,0:16:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want us to leave the treasure behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.42,0:16:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just found out Nolan and his\Nmen are getting ready to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.48,0:16:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moose, where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.84,0:16:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.56,0:16:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if you knew a single tree\Nwas tainted by the forest,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.92,0:16:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,spreading from tree to tree, from\Ntree to people, and killed the island?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.90,0:16:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if you knew about it beforehand?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.74,0:16:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.26,0:16:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, tell us what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.74,0:16:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we had a choice,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.82,0:17:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what would we do with that one tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.82,0:17:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.46,0:17:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.84,0:17:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to stop them. You fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.26,0:17:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand what they've done?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.12,0:17:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't leave things this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.86,0:17:18.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll regret it forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.44,0:17:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You finally made such a dear friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.14,0:17:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we owe them so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.76,0:17:26.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father, we can't leave\Nthem hurting like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.56,0:17:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.44,0:17:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no excuse, but on the\NCommodore's behalf, I must say this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.50,0:17:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those woods were already dead\Nbefore we arrived on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.50,0:17:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The worst thing about tree fever\Nis that it also infects plant life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.58,0:17:48.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commodore Noland understood this, and\Nthat was his reason for doing what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.68,0:17:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is also why he pleaded with\Nyou without regard for his own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.00,0:17:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From people to forest\Nand forest to people,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.10,0:18:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,several small islands have been\Ndestroyed in exactly the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.24,0:18:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Killed by fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.60,0:18:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.64,0:18:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yesterday, we finished inspecting\Nthe rest of the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.12,0:18:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry we cut down your\Nforest without knowing,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.58,0:18:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I feel worse that we\Nnever explained why we did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.70,0:18:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's probably unforgivable,\Neven with an explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.44,0:18:25.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But a botanist would never harm\Na forest without good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.26,0:18:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, the Commodore doesn't have\Nanything against gods or spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.86,0:18:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just that he always\Nhas to make a choice,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.58,0:18:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he always knows\Nwhat is most important.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.34,0:18:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, that means that they did all\Nof that to try to help our people?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.26,0:18:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.76,0:18:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Noland.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.72,0:18:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't leave yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.88,0:18:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does everyone have everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.34,0:19:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.08,0:19:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.68,0:19:06.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone, to your positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.10,0:19:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to set sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.44,0:19:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're now on our way back\Nto the Levineal Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.08,0:19:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.32,0:19:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Noland!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.96,0:19:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I made such a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.84,0:19:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Noland, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.74,0:19:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Set sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.14,0:19:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bell why would it be ringing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.70,0:19:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Nami
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.04,0:19:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ring louder!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.32,0:19:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nolan and the rest of them can't hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.34,0:19:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.76,0:20:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Nolan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.10,0:20:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that you, Kalgara?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.12,0:20:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.12,0:20:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back, please, Noland, you've got to!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.82,0:20:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll ring the bell so you\Ncan find your way back to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.06,0:20:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to lose sight\Nof this island, because one day!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.50,0:20:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to return my dear friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.80,0:20:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nolan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.48,0:20:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,please come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.90,0:21:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know we'll meet again?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.64,0:21:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,someday Nolan!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.80,0:21:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have a safe voyage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.20,0:21:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.94,0:21:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't come back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.88,0:21:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.64,0:21:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.90,0:21:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday, Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.66,0:21:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know we'll meet again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.84,0:21:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can always hear your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.62,0:21:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While you wander far from home!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.26,0:21:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gazing out at the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.78,0:21:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are just like the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.54,0:21:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never change as you\Nclimb into the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.46,0:22:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But your reflection wanes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.02,0:22:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you disappear, fading so silently.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.48,0:22:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay as you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.34,0:22:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't lose your way!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.94,0:22:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let these words guide you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.56,0:22:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't ever look back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.06,0:22:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up on your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.42,0:22:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're endless nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.78,0:22:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They come to you again and again?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.80,0:22:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until you see the journey through.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.52,0:22:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may not return, I\Nhope that you'll learn!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.42,0:22:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To put your past behind,\Nand just keep moving on.

